      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 4.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.73,
      "end_seconds": 8.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.75,
      "end_seconds": 15.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "Um, so... a cough for three weeks. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.3,
      "end_seconds": 19.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.89,
      "end_seconds": 30.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.3,
      "end_seconds": 63.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.28,
      "text": "okay: pulse is 67 beats a minute, blood pressure 119 over 77, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temp 36.8 degrees, respiratory rate 17. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.78,
      "end_seconds": 68.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.57,
      "end_seconds": 71.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.39,
      "end_seconds": 74.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "it's mild, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.92,
      "end_seconds": 79.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "so, have you been losing weight?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.21,
      "end_seconds": 84.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, I've had that since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.89,
      "end_seconds": 96.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "And what about HIV, coughing up blood or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.78,
      "end_seconds": 102.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "no, no HIV, coughing up blood or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.29,
      "end_seconds": 107.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.32,
      "end_seconds": 110.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.92,
      "end_seconds": 117.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.91,
      "end_seconds": 121.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "No, um, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.89,
      "end_seconds": 123.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.08,
      "end_seconds": 128.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.79,
      "end_seconds": 146.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.96,
      "end_seconds": 167.23,
      "duration_seconds": 19.27,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I only drink at family occasions. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I live with my elderly mother. I retired from the post office two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.65,
      "end_seconds": 188.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.33,
      "end_seconds": 192.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.9,
      "end_seconds": 196.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.42,
      "end_seconds": 201.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.56,
      "end_seconds": 219.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Alright, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.23,
      "end_seconds": 224.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "no, I've always been fairly healthy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.41,
      "end_seconds": 227.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.2,
      "end_seconds": 229.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.8,
      "end_seconds": 233.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "hold that for a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.23,
      "end_seconds": 244.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "There are some crackles at the top of the right lung."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.51,
      "end_seconds": 260.6,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "all finished, thank you from what you've told me and what I found, it points towards possible tuberculosis i think a chest X-ray makes sense here, for prolonged cough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.52,
      "end_seconds": 265.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.26,
      "end_seconds": 284.37,
      "duration_seconds": 17.11,
      "text": "I think three sputum samples makes sense here, for possible tuberculosis. Wear a mask in public and cover your mouth when you cough until the the results are back. The TB service would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.53,
      "end_seconds": 287.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.25,
      "end_seconds": 301.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.5,
      "text": "if the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's review you after the tests. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.2,
      "end_seconds": 304.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.24,
      "end_seconds": 310.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
